    <section class="mis-blq mis-panel"><div class="mis-env">
      <div class="mis-kick">How I publish</div>
      <h2 class="mis-tit">Three rules</h2>
      <div class="mis-rej">
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">01</span><h3>Method comes first</h3><p>Anyone should be able to reproduce the result without asking me for permission.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">02</span><h3>Data stays in the territory</h3><p>The community owns what was collected about it and keeps the full dataset.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt mis-esp"></i><span class="mis-et">03</span><h3>State the uncertainty</h3><p>Every study states its limits and its margins of error.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
